<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper:      #f2f1ec;
    --paper-2:    #e9e7e0;
    --ink:        #1c1b17;
    --ink-2:      #52514e;
    --ink-3:      #79776f;
    --rule:       #c9c7be;
    --accent:     #1f3a5f;
    --accent-2:   #9c4221;
    --blue:       #2a78d6;
    --critical:   #b5302f;
    --card:       #fbfaf7;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --paper:      #171613;
      --paper-2:    #201f1b;
      --ink:        #f2f1ec;
      --ink-2:      #bcbab0;
      --ink-3:      #8f8d84;
      --rule:       #3c3b35;
      --accent:     #7fa4d4;
      --accent-2:   #e0916a;
      --blue:       #5598e7;
      --critical:   #e2807f;
      --card:       #1e1d19;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --paper:      #171613;
    --paper-2:    #201f1b;
    --ink:        #f2f1ec;
    --ink-2:      #bcbab0;
    --ink-3:      #8f8d84;
    --rule:       #3c3b35;
    --accent:     #7fa4d4;
    --accent-2:   #e0916a;
    --blue:       #5598e7;
    --critical:   #e2807f;
    --card:       #1e1d19;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }
  .masthead {
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }
  h1.title {
    font-size: 2.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }
  .meta-row {
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.4rem;
  }
  .meta-row strong { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 600; }

  .abstract {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    margin: 2.2rem 0 3rem;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
  }
  .abstract-label {
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    display: block;
  }

  section { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  }
  h2 .num { color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 500; margin-right: 0.5em; }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 1.8rem 0 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  p { margin: 0 0 1.1rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--ink); }
  em.term { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  strong.flag { color: var(--accent-2); font-weight: 600; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }

  .callout {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-2);
    padding: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.2rem;
    margin: 1.6rem 0;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .callout strong { color: var(--ink); }

  figure { margin: 1.8rem 0; }
  figure.wide { margin-left: calc(-1 * (min(100vw, 900px) - 760px) / 2 + 1.5rem);
                margin-right: calc(-1 * (min(100vw, 900px) - 760px) / 2 + 1.5rem); }
  figure img, figure svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  /* Figures are static, matplotlib-rendered on dark ink -- fixed light card
     regardless of page theme, same convention as a printed figure in a paper. */
  .figure-card {
    background: #fbfaf7;
    border: 1px solid #d8d6cd;
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1rem;
  }
  figcaption {
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  figcaption strong { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 600; }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 1.6rem;
  }
  caption {
    caption-side: top;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  th, td {
    text-align: right;
    padding: 0.42rem 0.55rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align: left; white-space: normal; }
  thead th {
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink-2);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink-2); }
  .sig { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }

  ul.limitations { padding-left: 1.3rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  ul.limitations li { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .footer a { color: var(--ink-3); }

  .status-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .status-pill.done { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 18%, transparent); color: var(--accent); }
  .status-pill.blocked { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--critical) 18%, transparent); color: var(--critical); }

  code { font-family: 'Public Sans', monospace; font-size: 0.88em; background: var(--paper-2); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 3px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <header class="masthead">
    <p class="kicker">Working paper &middot; Unwatched research project</p>
    <h1 class="title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</p>
    <div class="meta-row">
      <span><strong>Geography</strong> Oakland, CA (primary) + 14 more cities</span>
      <span><strong>Unit of analysis</strong> Census tract (primary), block group (robustness)</span>
      <span><strong>Data vintage</strong> {{ data_vintage }}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="abstract">
    <span class="abstract-label">Abstract</span>
    {{ abstract | safe }}
  </div>

  {{ body | safe }}

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Prepared as a standalone econometric analysis for the Unwatched anti-surveillance research project. Code, data pipeline, and full model outputs live in <code>analysis/latino-exposure/</code> of the project repository — see <code>SCOPE.md</code> for the full methodology log, and <code>src/models.py</code> (Oakland baseline), <code>src/multi_city.py</code> (city acquisition pipeline), <code>src/pooled_model.py</code> and <code>src/multi_city_race_class.py</code> (per-city and pooled regressions), and <code>src/hierarchical_model.py</code> (the Bayesian multilevel model) for the code behind each section. Camera data: OpenStreetMap contributors / DeFlock project. Demographic data: U.S. Census Bureau, American Community Survey 2023 5-year estimates. Crime data: city-specific official open-data feeds (Oakland, Fresno, Albuquerque, Phoenix, Fort Worth, Denver, Sacramento, Seattle) — see &sect;7 for sources, coverage windows, and caveats per city. Road network: OpenStreetMap.</p>
  </div>
</div>
